{"seq":1,"slug":"sse-streaming","title":"SSE 流式响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-agent-handbook/streaming-and-chat/sse-streaming","wordCount":1019,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"sse-流式响应\">SSE 流式响应</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>流式响应解决的是「等待」问题：大模型生成一段完整回复可能要数秒，若等全部生成完再返回，用户面对的是一段没有反馈的空白。流式把 token 一边生成一边推送，用户实时看到文字逐步出现。</p>\n<p>实现它的标准协议是 Server-Sent Events（SSE）。SSE 是服务端到客户端的单向推送，建立在普通 HTTP 长连接之上，天然契合「模型生成、客户端消费」的形态——不像 WebSocket 那样为双向通信引入额外握手与状态。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>SSE</th>\n<th>WebSocket</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>方向</td>\n<td>服务端 → 客户端单向</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>协议</td>\n<td>基于 HTTP，<code>text/event-stream</code></td>\n<td>独立 <code>ws://</code> 协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重连</td>\n<td>浏览器原生自动重连</td>\n<td>需自行实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>模型流式输出、日志推送</td>\n<td>实时协作、双向交互</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 AI SDK 6 中，服务端用 <code>streamText</code> 产出 token 流，<code>toUIMessageStreamResponse()</code> 负责转成 SSE 事件格式；客户端既可用 <code>useChat</code> 一行接入，也可手动解析 <code>ReadableStream</code>。理解这条链路，是后续所有实时交互功能的基础。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要流式响应\">为什么需要流式响应</h2><p>大语言模型生成一段完整回复可能需要数秒甚至更长时间。如果等待全部生成完毕再返回，用户会面对一段漫长的空白等待。流式响应让 token 一边生成一边推送到客户端，用户能实时看到文字逐步出现，体验上接近&quot;AI 正在思考并打字&quot;的效果。</p>\n<p>Server-Sent Events（SSE）是实现流式响应的标准协议。与 WebSocket 的双向通信不同，SSE 是服务端到客户端的单向推送，天然适合&quot;模型生成、客户端消费&quot;的场景。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant Client as React 客户端&#10;    participant Server as Hono API&#10;    participant Model as LLM Provider&#10;&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;Server: POST /api/chat (messages)&#10;    Server-&gt;&gt;Model: streamText(messages)&#10;    loop 逐 token 生成&#10;        Model--&gt;&gt;Server: token chunk&#10;        Server--&gt;&gt;Client: data: {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;chunk&quot;}\\n\\n&#10;    end&#10;    Model--&gt;&gt;Server: [DONE]&#10;    Server--&gt;&gt;Client: event: done\\n\\n&#10;    Client-&gt;&gt;Client: 关闭 EventSource\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant Client as React 客户端\n    participant Server as Hono API\n    participant Model as LLM Provider\n\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Server: POST /api/chat (messages)\n    Server-&gt;&gt;Model: streamText(messages)\n    loop 逐 token 生成\n        Model--&gt;&gt;Server: token chunk\n        Server--&gt;&gt;Client: data: {\"text\": \"chunk\"}\\n\\n\n    end\n    Model--&gt;&gt;Server: [DONE]\n    Server--&gt;&gt;Client: event: done\\n\\n\n    Client-&gt;&gt;Client: 关闭 EventSource</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"sse-协议基础\">SSE 协议基础</h2><p>SSE 使用 <code>text/event-stream</code> 内容类型，通过 HTTP 长连接推送事件。每个事件由 <code>data:</code> 字段和两个换行符分隔：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"data: {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;你&quot;}&#10;&#10;data: {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;好&quot;}&#10;&#10;data: {&quot;text&quot;: &quot;！&quot;}&#10;&#10;data: [DONE]&#10;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>data: {\"text\": \"你\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data: {\"text\": \"好\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data: {\"text\": \"！\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>data: [DONE]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键 HTTP 头：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>头字段</th>\n<th>值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Content-Type</td>\n<td><code>text/event-stream</code></td>\n<td>标识 SSE 协议</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cache-Control</td>\n<td><code>no-cache</code></td>\n<td>禁止缓存流式数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Connection</td>\n<td><code>keep-alive</code></td>\n<td>保持长连接</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Transfer-Encoding</td>\n<td><code>chunked</code></td>\n<td>分块传输编码</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"hono-流式路由\">Hono 流式路由</h2><p>使用 AI SDK 6 的 <code>streamText</code> 配合 Hono 实现流式端点：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Hono } from &#39;hono&#39;;&#10;import { streamText, convertToModelMessages } from &#39;ai&#39;;&#10;import { openai } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;;&#10;&#10;const app = new Hono();&#10;&#10;app.post(&#39;/api/chat&#39;, async (c) =&gt; {&#10;  const { messages } = await c.req.json();&#10;&#10;  const result = streamText({&#10;    model: openai(&#39;gpt-5&#39;),&#10;    messages: await convertToModelMessages(messages),&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return result.toUIMessageStreamResponse();&#10;});&#10;&#10;export default app;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Hono } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hono'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { streamText, convertToModelMessages } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { openai } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Hono</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/chat'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">messages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c.req.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">json</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> streamText</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openai</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'gpt-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    messages: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> convertToModelMessages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(messages),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toUIMessageStreamResponse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> app;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>toUIMessageStreamResponse()</code> 自动设置正确的 SSE 头并将 token 流转换为符合 AI SDK UI Message Stream 协议 的事件格式。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义流式响应\">自定义流式响应</h2><p>当需要更细粒度的控制时，可以手动构造 SSE 流：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Hono } from &#39;hono&#39;;&#10;import { streamText, convertToModelMessages } from &#39;ai&#39;;&#10;import { openai } from &#39;@ai-sdk/openai&#39;;&#10;import { stream } from &#39;hono/streaming&#39;;&#10;&#10;const app = new Hono();&#10;&#10;app.post(&#39;/api/chat/custom&#39;, async (c) =&gt; {&#10;  const { messages } = await c.req.json();&#10;&#10;  const result = streamText({&#10;    model: openai(&#39;gpt-5&#39;),&#10;    messages: await convertToModelMessages(messages),&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return stream(&#10;    c,&#10;    async (s) =&gt; {&#10;      for await (const chunk of result.textStream) {&#10;        await s.write(`data: ${JSON.stringify({ text: chunk })}\\n\\n`);&#10;      }&#10;      await s.write(&#39;data: [DONE]\\n\\n&#39;);&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      headers: {&#10;        &#39;Content-Type&#39;: &#39;text/event-stream&#39;,&#10;        &#39;Cache-Control&#39;: &#39;no-cache&#39;,&#10;        Connection: &#39;keep-alive&#39;,&#10;      },&#10;    },&#10;  );&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Hono } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hono'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { streamText, convertToModelMessages } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { openai } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@ai-sdk/openai'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { stream } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'hono/streaming'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> app</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Hono</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">app.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">post</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/api/chat/custom'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">messages</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=